// ============================================================
// PUBLIC ANNOUNCEMENTS DATA HOOK
// ============================================================
// Powers BOTH:
//   1. The homepage teaser (usePublicHomeData-style): latest 6
//      active announcements across every category.
//   2. The dedicated /public-announcements page: the full active
